@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix : <http://example.org/ontology#>.

### Classes ###
:Concepts a owl:Class.
:Relationships a owl:Class.
:Classes a owl:Class.
:Instances a owl:Class.
:Accuracy a owl:Class.
:DomainRepresentation a owl:Class.
:ValidationTechniques a owl:Class.
:DomainExpertInvolvement a owl:Class.
:Role a owl:Class.
:Organization a owl:Class.
:Project a owl:Class.
:Author a owl:Class.
:Journal a owl:Class.
:Location a owl:Class.
:Date a owl:Class.
:ConflictingInformation a owl:Class.
:AmbiguousInformation a owl:Class.
:IndustryStandards a owl:Class.
:BestPractices a owl:Class.
:DevelopmentProcess a owl:Class.
:Validation a owl:Class.
:Compliance a owl:Class.
:DomainExpert a owl:Class.
:Stakeholder a owl:Class.
:Requirement a owl:Class.
:Name a owl:Class.
:Description a owl:Class.
:Version a owl:Class.
:Update a owl:Class.
:Modify a owl:Class.
:Accommodate a owl:Class.
:Approach a owl:Class.
:Scalability a owl:Class.
:Flexibility a owl:Class.
:Modularity a owl:Class.
:Changes a owl:Class.
:Expansions a owl:Class.
:Forest a owl:Class.
:Trend a owl:Class.
:Technology a owl:Class.

### Object Properties ###
:hasConcept a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasRelationship a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasClass a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasClassInstance a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasRole a owl:ObjectProperty.
:worksFor a owl:ObjectProperty.
:contributesTo a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasAuthor a owl:ObjectProperty.
:publishedIn a owl:ObjectProperty.
:takesPlaceAt a owl:ObjectProperty.
:hasDate a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Source a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Resolution a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Alignment a owl:ObjectProperty.
:DevelopmentProcess a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Validation a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Compliance a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Name a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Expertise a owl:ObjectProperty.
:ContactInformation a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Role a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Priority a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Status a owl:ObjectProperty.
:LatestDevelopments a owl:ObjectProperty.
:Techniques a owl:ObjectProperty.
:type a owl:ObjectProperty.

### Datatype Properties ###
:Description a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Changes a owl:DatatypeProperty.
:Expansions a owl:DatatypeProperty.

### Individuals ###
:Ontology rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasConcept :Concepts;
    :hasRelationship :Relationships;
    :hasClass :Classes;
    :hasClassInstance :Instances;
    :Accuracy :Accuracy;
    :DomainRepresentation :DomainRepresentation;
    :Alignment :IndustryStandards,
                :BestPractices;
    :DevelopmentProcess :DevelopmentProcess;
    :Validation :Validation;
    :Compliance :Compliance;
    :Name :Name;
    :Description :Description;
    :Version :Version;
    :Update :Update;
    :Modify :Modify;
    :Accommodate :Accommodate;
    :Approach :Approach;
    :Scalability :Scalability;
    :Flexibility :Flexibility;
    :Modularity :Modularity.

:Person rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasRole :Role;
    :worksFor :Organization;
    :contributesTo :Project.

:Publication rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :hasAuthor :Author;
    :publishedIn :Journal.

:Event rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :takesPlaceAt :Location;
    :hasDate :Date.

:ConflictingInformation rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :Source "String";
    :Resolution "String".

:AmbiguousInformation rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :Source "String";
    :Resolution "String".

:DomainExpert rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :Name :Name;
    :Expertise :Expertise;
    :ContactInformation :ContactInformation.

:Stakeholder rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :Name :Name;
    :Role :Role;
    :ContactInformation :ContactInformation.

:Requirement rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :Description :Description;
    :Priority :Priority;
    :Status :Status.

:Animal rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :type :Forest.

:OntologyDevelopment rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual;
    :LatestDevelopments :Trend;
    :Techniques :Technology.